1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
 Harga AI buat coding bisa beda 5x lipat.

2
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:06,720
 Tapi, performanya juga beda sejauh itu.

3
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,320
 Kita bandingin 3 model.

4
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:13,200
 Kimi K3.1 Pro, Cloud Opus 5.5 dan GPT6 Astra.

5
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:15,600
 Di tarif API Standard per sejuta token,

6
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:18,280
 Kimi 2 dolar input dan 10 dolar output.

7
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,800
 Opus 4 dan 20.

8
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:22,480
 Astra, 10 dan 50 dolar.

9
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,080
 Sekarang benchmarknya.

10
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:27,760
 Di Kimi Code Bench 3.0, test internal moonshot,

11
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,920
 Astra dapat 66.5.

12
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:34,280
 Kimi 61.2 dan Opus 58.5.

13
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:37,800
 Tapi di angkat terminal Bench 4.0 yang dikumpulkan moonshot,

14
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:40,720
 Opus unggul tipis dengan 66.4.

15
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,040
 Kimi 65.7 dan Astra 58.2.

16
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,600
 Ingat, pengaturan testnya nggak selalu sama.

17
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:51,440
 Dan harga pertoken belum tentu menggambarkan biaya menyelesaikan satu proyek.

18
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:54,000
 Jadi, kalau kamu pakai AI buat coding,

19
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:58,000
 lebih pilih tarif hemat atau performa yang paling cocok buat kebutuhanmu.

